            "description": "<p>Together, Kylie, Sebastian, and Dylan explored styles and categories that embody both brands and audiences, crafting an assortment that fuses innovation with practicality. Guided by their shared vision to create a robust offering that provides wardrobe solutions for different occasions, they intentionally incorporated variety into the assortment. The vegan fur ties in texture for a warm, inviting essence, juxtaposed by the strong structure of the silhouettes. The tailoring, which is both a subtle nod to Kylie’s entrepreneurial success and a signature style of Entire Studios, is a message of empowerment. The draping adds dimension and fluidity, celebrating the growth and evolutions of both brands. <br/><br/></p><h5><br/><br/><a href=\"/collections/entire-studios-pt2\" title=\"Khy x Entire Studios Pt. 2\"><strong>SHOP KHY X ENTIRE STUDIOS</strong></a></h5>",
